   'deep',
   '{"summary":"Never parse URI params into objects via __proto__; use Object.create(null) or safe query parsers.","steps":["Parse query strings with libraries that block __proto__ and constructor keys.","Freeze Object.prototype in client bundles where feasible.","Validate script src values against an allowlist instead of reading polluted prototype keys."]}'::jsonb,
