   'deep',
   '{"summary":"the-internet is intentional Selenium training — use fuzzy or partial text matching for non-deterministic copy.","steps":["Assert on stable structural elements instead of exact typo-prone strings.","Use regex or contains matchers when page text varies between loads.","Run the-internet only on isolated training infrastructure."]}'::jsonb,
