   'deep',
   '{"summary":"Enforce per-poll vote limits with IP, device, or authenticated identity binding.","steps":["Track votes by user account or verified identity, not only session cookies.","Rate-limit POST /api/vote and require CAPTCHA for anonymous voters.","Run Voting App only on isolated scanner evaluation infrastructure."]}'::jsonb,
   'Our vote endpoint accepts multiple anonymous votes from fresh sessions. Show vote stuffing remediation.',
   true),
  ('voting-app-vote-stuffing-route-live-oracle', 'generic', 'Business logic', 'high',
